    { "chunk_id": "C5", "quote": "D. You shall promptly pay all sums owing to AIRSOPURE and its subsidiaries and affiliates, including all damages, costs and expenses, including reasonable attorneys' fees, incurred by AIRSOPURE as a result of the default." }
